{
  "id": 8834725576903,
  "title": "Winter Cat and Cardinal Sitting on Snowy Patchwork Christmas Quilt",
  "handle": "winter-cat-and-cardinal-sitting-on-snowy-patchwork-christmas-quilt-82f86611f4-82f86611f4",
  "body_html": "<p>Add a cozy, heartwarming touch to your bedroom decor with this beautiful quilt from Jeminise. Featuring a charming winter scene of a cat and cardinal bird sitting on a snowy branch, this lightweight bedspread brings a touch of seasonal nature indoors. Perfect for keeping you comfortable through chilly winter nights or as a thoughtful customized gift for pet and bird lovers alike.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Easily personalize your bedding by adding custom text, name, or selecting your preferred size and optional matching pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made with a breathable, soft polyester outer fabric and filled with high-quality silk floss for lightweight, all-season warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Detailed Winter Design:</strong> Features a realistic 3D patchwork print of a cat and cardinal bird on snowy branches decorated with snowflakes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Ideal as a bed quilt, cozy throw blanket, picnic mat, or travel blanket for camping and outdoor activities.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on a low-heat or air-dry setting to keep it fluffy and soft.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Xmas Red Bird-02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Animal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Bird</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cardinal Bird Winter Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw, Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
